<Slide style={{ padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', height: '100%', gap: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>七项不是一样重：哪项该攻，哪项该保</Text>
            <Box style={{ height: 3, width: '100%', background: '#E2E8F0' }} />
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 660, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#1D4ED8', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#93C5FD', letterSpacing: 1 }}>主攻区</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>50 米跑 ＋ 1000 / 800 米跑</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>40%</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C7D9F8', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>两项加起来占四成，是及格线和良好线之间最大的那道沟。这两项练上去，总分立刻换档。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 12, padding: 26 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3B82F6', letterSpacing: 1 }}>稳住区</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>BMI ＋ 肺活量</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>30%</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>三成不靠跑，靠平时的体重和呼吸习惯。BMI 正常就白拿满分，胖一斤瘦一斤都掉分。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 560, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', letterSpacing: 1 }}>顺手区</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>坐位体前屈 ＋ 立定跳远</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>20%</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>靠方法和柔韧，几周就能见效，性价比最高。</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 400, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', background: '#FFF7ED', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, border: '1px solid #FED7AA' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#EA580C', letterSpacing: 1 }}>补漏区</Text>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>引体向上 / 仰卧起坐</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EA580C', lineHeight: 1.1 }}>10%</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#7C2D12', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>男生最容易被这一项拖住，但它只占一成——别为它放弃其他。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, bottom: 24, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#CBD5E1' }}>山东药品食品职业学院 · 质量管理系 ·「童健韶华」志愿服务队</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#CBD5E1' }}>12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
